      "created_at": "2015-10-05T21:33:34.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Played a random game in the digital version, giving me Cosmic Omnitron in Megalopolis vs. Mr. Fixer, Unity, Absolute Zero, and Argent Adept. Cosmic Omnitron wiped the floor with me, destroying all equipment twice and destroying all ongoings twice. A lot of my effort went in to stopping an EPE.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>So, tried again. Much better this time. When Omnitron brought out Adaptive Plating, I looked at Unity's interleaved Raptors and Platform Bots and just smiled. Fixer started with Dual Crowbars and Grease Monkey. Ended the game with all heroes in the high teens, despite having ongoings and equipment wiped a couple of times. Unity's Bots are neither!</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
